    "Every letter has come home. Perhaps it is time to write another." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一封信都已归来。也许，是时候再写一封了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every letter is a small act of faith in tomorrow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一封信，都是对明天的一次小小信任。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every letter is dressed for its journey. Swipe to find the one that feels like you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每封信都要为旅途换上衣裳。左右滑动，找到最像你的那一张。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every letter keeps the paper it was written on. You can change yours any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每封信都会留住写下它的那张纸。你的信纸，随时可以更换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every letter needs someone waiting at the other end of time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一封信，都需要有人在时间的另一端等候。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything stays on this device. Shared letters are encrypted; the date is enforced by the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切都只留在这台设备上。分享的信件经过加密；开启日期由本应用把关。"
