        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "风格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take your time. The future is a patient reader." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "慢慢写。未来是个耐心的读者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the envelope" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点信封"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to finish" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to record" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点录音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell them the word your own way. It isn't case-sensitive, and it can't be recovered if forgotten." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用你自己的方式把暗语告诉对方。暗语不区分大小写，一旦遗忘便无法找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That secret word doesn't open this letter. Try again — the hint might help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个暗语打不开这封信。再试一次吧——提示或许能帮上忙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The day has come · 时候到了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "约定之日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The journey" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "旅程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The letter you sent can now be opened" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你寄出的信，现在可以开启了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The letter you sent to %@ can now be opened" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你寄给%@的信，现在可以开启了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The letter, its memories and your reply will be gone for good." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这封信、信中的回忆和你的回信，都将永远消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question you answered" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你回答过的问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The river is still." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "河面一片静谧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The river of time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间之河"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sealed letter can no longer be found on this device. Ask the sender to share it with you again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这台设备上已找不到这封封存的信。请让寄信人再分享给你一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wait is over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待结束了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对方的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This doesn't seem to be a Timeleaf letter, or it was creased on its way to you. Ask the sender to share it once more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这似乎不是一封时笺的信，或是在寄来的路上被折损了。请让寄信人再分享一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how your letter will be signed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的信将以此落款。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This letter is too large to send as a file (over 300 MB)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这封信太大，无法作为文件发送（超过 300 MB）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This letter is too large to send as a file. It stays safe in your vault." : {
