    "Voices" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you afraid of, and what would you tell that fear?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在害怕什么？你想对那份害怕说些什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you learning, slowly?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你正在慢慢学会什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What are you proud of that nobody noticed?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有什么事让你骄傲，却没有人注意到？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you believe now that you hope you still believe?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻你相信的事里，哪些是你希望将来依然相信的？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you hope hasn't changed?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你希望什么还没有改变？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you hope you will have let go of?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你希望到那时，自己已经放下了什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you want to forgive yourself for?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你想原谅自己什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you want to remember about the people around you?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于身边的人，你想记住些什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What does an ordinary Tuesday look like for you?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你寻常的一个星期二，是什么样子？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is the weather like — outside, and inside?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "天气如何——窗外的，和心里的？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should we call you?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该怎么称呼你？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What small thing made you smile today?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天，有什么小事让你笑了？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What smells like home to you right now?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻，什么气味让你想起家？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you do with one completely free day?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果有一整天完全属于你，你会怎么过？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you like to ask the one reading this?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你想问读信的人什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you tell the you of one year ago?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你想对一年前的自己说些什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you seal today, you will open as someone new." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天封存的，将由一个崭新的你来开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When should it arrive?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它该在何时抵达？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the brush rests, the mist begins." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "笔歇之处，烟岚始生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which dream are you quietly carrying?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你正悄悄怀揣着哪一个梦？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which promise do you want your future self to keep?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你希望未来的自己守住哪一个承诺？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which song is on repeat these days?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近单曲循环的是哪首歌？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who do you miss right now, and why?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻你在想念谁？为什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who made your life lighter this month?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个月，是谁让你的日子轻盈了一些？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a secret word, it's Timeleaf — not the encryption — that keeps the date. Add one to lock it for real." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有暗语时，守住日期的是时笺，而不是加密。加上暗语，才算真正上锁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words, photos, voices and videos" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字、照片、声音与视频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words, photos, your voice, a few seconds of video — folded into one letter and sealed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字、照片、你的声音、几秒钟的影像——折进同一封信里，就此封存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "书写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a letter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写一封信"
          }
        }
